{"id":"n70d8447b6366","url":"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/international-day-older-persons-healthy-ageing-starts-across-life-course","title":"International day of older persons: Healthy ageing starts across the life course","source":"FDI World Dental Federation","date":"2026-02-10T12:00:00.000Z","byline":"","image":"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_xs/public/2026-08/OHAP%2010-Year%20Anniversary%20Infographic_2026.jpg?itok=1Izul_JA","imageKind":"","imageBg":"","html":"<p>Ten years of action, collaboration and progress. Explore how FDI’s OHAP initiative has helped advance oral health for healthy ageing worldwide.</p> <figure> Image <picture> <source srcset=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plan_1x_xl/public/2026-08/OHAP%2010-Year%20Anniversary%20Infographic_2026.jpg?itok=qHqQiip7 1x, https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_2x_xl/public/2026-08/OHAP%2010-Year%20Anniversary%20Infographic_2026.jpg?itok=JFjkhj7K 2x\" type=\"image/jpeg\"> <source srcset=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_lg/public/2026-08/OHAP%2010-Year%20Anniversary%20Infographic_2026.jpg?itok=HMh1gOzS 1x, https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_2x_lg/public/2026-08/OHAP%2010-Year%20Anniversary%20Infographic_2026.jpg?itok=gIKvSU99 2x\" type=\"image/jpeg\"> <source srcset=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_md/public/2026-08/OHAP%2010-Year%20Anniversary%20Infographic_2026.jpg?itok=Ygol0KRF 1x, https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_2x_md/public/2026-08/OHAP%2010-Year%20Anniversary%20Infographic_2026.jpg?itok=uYrNjZ32 2x\" type=\"image/jpeg\"> <source srcset=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_sm/public/2026-08/OHAP%2010-Year%20Anniversary%20Infographic_2026.jpg?itok=aSiwgR1F 1x, https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_2x_sm/public/2026-08/OHAP%2010-Year%20Anniversary%20Infographic_2026.jpg?itok=JlJdaq5w 2x\" type=\"image/jpeg\"> <source srcset=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_xs/public/2026-08/OHAP%2010-Year%20Anniversary%20Infographic_2026.jpg?itok=1Izul_JA 1x, https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_2x_xs/public/2026-08/OHAP%2010-Year%20Anniversary%20Infographic_2026.jpg?itok=Yry4gZjJ 2x\" type=\"image/jpeg\"> <img src=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_xs/public/2026-08/OHAP%2010-Year%20Anniversary%20Infographic_2026.jpg?itok=1Izul_JA\" alt=\"FDI OHAP 10-Year Anniversary Infographic\" loading=\"lazy\"> </picture> </figure> <p><a href=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/2026-08/OHAP-10-Year-Anniversary-Infographic-2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">See the infographic</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>In celebrating the International Day of Older Persons on 1 October, FDI reaffirms the importance of supporting healthy ageing throughout the life course. For FDI, this day also provides an opportunity to reflect on the critical role of oral health and oral function in enabling older adults to maintain their health, independence and quality of life.</p>\n<p>Since 2015, FDI has been working through the <a href=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/oral-health-ageing-population\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>Oral Health for an Ageing Population (OHAP) initiative</strong></a> to raise awareness of the importance of oral health in healthy ageing and to support dental professionals, National Dental Associations (NDAs), policymakers and other stakeholders in addressing the oral health needs of ageing populations.</p>\n<p>Over the past decade, OHAP has produced a range of practical resources and tools designed to support this vision. These include the Chairside Guide, Frailty Guide and Exercise Brochure, as well as the Lucerne Pathway, each contributing to the broader objective of maintaining oral function, preventing oral diseases, and addressing oral and general frailty. More recently, the OHAP Advocacy Guide, launched in 2025, provided NDAs, oral health advocates and policymakers with an additional practical tool to promote the integration of oral care into healthy ageing strategies and policies.</p>\n<p>As OHAP reaches its <strong>10-year milestone</strong>, made possible through the generous and longstanding support of <strong>GC International&nbsp;</strong>and the<strong> Nakao Foundation</strong>, we are taking this opportunity to celebrate a decade of collaboration and progress in advancing oral health for healthy ageing.</p>\n<p>To mark this milestone, FDI has also developed a <a href=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/ohap-10-years-infographic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>10-year OHAP infographic</strong></a>, highlighting the journey of the initiative, the resources developed, and how OHAP has worked to scale its impact across different care settings and reach older adults, dental professionals, caregivers and policymakers.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Reaching ten years also provides an opportunity to reflect on what has been achieved and to consider how the work of OHAP can continue to reach and benefit more people. As the initiative moves into this next stage, FDI looks forward to building on the strong foundation established over the past decade and exploring opportunities to further promote the global implementation of the resources developed through OHAP.</p>\n<p>On this International Day of Older Persons, we celebrate a decade of OHAP and the shared commitment to making oral health an integral part of healthy ageing—and look forward to continuing this important work together.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>Related resources</h2> <figure> <ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/media/1003/edit?destination=/node/3074\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Edit</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/media/1003/translations?destination=/node/3074\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Translate</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/media/1003/delete?destination=/node/3074\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Delete</a></li>\n</ul> Image\n\n<picture><source srcset=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plan_1x_xl/public/2021-01/ageing%20population.jpg?itok=bTuQrhlp 1x, https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_2x_xl/public/2021-01/ageing%20population.jpg?itok=7N7Z3icC 2x\" type=\"image/jpeg\"><source srcset=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_lg/public/2021-01/ageing%20population.jpg?itok=oBEUBErO 1x, https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_2x_lg/public/2021-01/ageing%20population.jpg?itok=B4e3oDoO 2x\" type=\"image/jpeg\"><source srcset=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_md/public/2021-01/ageing%20population.jpg?itok=h0U6uOQw 1x, https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_2x_md/public/2021-01/ageing%20population.jpg?itok=ObSn_ukS 2x\" type=\"image/jpeg\"><source srcset=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_sm/public/2021-01/ageing%20population.jpg?itok=p8ipFSKH 1x, https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_2x_sm/public/2021-01/ageing%20population.jpg?itok=WnG02EN1 2x\" type=\"image/jpeg\"><source srcset=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_xs/public/2021-01/ageing%20population.jpg?itok=RlRnajTi 1x, https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_2x_xs/public/2021-01/ageing%20population.jpg?itok=Lh4yRWai 2x\" type=\"image/jpeg\"><img src=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_xs/public/2021-01/ageing%20population.jpg?itok=RlRnajTi\" alt=\"Agei